version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-13
repository-code: "https://github.com/hamoonea/insurance-ai-evidence-verification"
abstract: >-
  Development prototype comparing direct answers, generic self-review, and
  evidence verification for missing-information handling in scoped healthcare
  insurance policy questions. Includes 12 fictional AI-drafted development cases.
  Includes a 36-generation CPU pilot with mixed results and retained failures.
  Case annotations await independent review; no held-out claims are made.
